{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cvInmPm1tr1795759279.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地流感病毒檢測陽性率上升，國家疾控部門指，已進入呼吸道傳染病高發季節，提醒民眾接種疫苗。</p><p></p><p>中國疾控中心公布，上周一至周日的呼吸道傳染病監測情況顯示，檢測出的陽性樣本中，H1N1甲型流感病毒佔六成半，H3N2甲型流感病毒有近一成，而乙型流感佔比超過百分之25。檢測年齡組別中，5至14歲陽性比例最高。</p><p></p><p>當局提醒民眾要主動接種流感疫苗，到人員聚集場所要戴口罩，做好預防措施。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:23:55.077475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:14.818392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:16.976463+00:00","content_hash":"b5066e7c3bd6c7ef73bd0edf3fcee31f64b465e800288c1680f9c972d9ca66ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:23:55.077475+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}